id: opening-flip
name: Opening Flip
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score of 8+
tpCost: 7
# "If you win the Might Clash for Judo Toss, instead of moving that Opponent, you may knock them Prone" - a button on
# the won Clash.
judoFlip: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Judo Toss's Might Clash won: knock them Prone instead of moving them.
text: >
  Opening Flip: Rather than slinging your enemy away along their own trajectory, you flip them onto their back so that
  you may take greater advantage of their new prone position.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 7
  –Effect: If you win the Might Clash for Judo Toss, instead of moving that Opponent, you may knock them Prone.
